            <td>Brief overlap (March–April &amp; October–Nov)</td>
            <td>Sydney / Melbourne vs New York / Atlanta</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="chart-note">Note: Queensland (including Brisbane and the Gold Coast) remains on AEST (UTC+10) year-round and does not observe daylight saving time.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     LIVE INTERACTIVE CONVERTER TOOL & HERO ILLUSTRATION
