      <p>Alternatively, holding meetings between <strong>10:00 PM and 11:30 PM AEST</strong> aligns with <strong>7:00 AM and 8:30 AM EST</strong>. This enables US team members starting their morning to connect with Australian team members before the Australian close of evening.</p>
    </article>
